/// Spike 3: one `#transient` accept-loop child, as `AcceptorSupervisor` will
/// hold one `Acceptor`. Args: `#acceptorClass`, `#listenSocket`, `#tableName`
/// and `#shutdown` (the child's shutdown timeout in ms).
Supervisor subclass: AcceptLoopSupervisor

  childSpecs =>
    #((((self args at: #acceptorClass) supervisionSpec
      withId: #acceptor
      withRestart: #transient
      withArgs: #{
        #listenSocket => (self args at: #listenSocket),
        #tableName => (self args at: #tableName)
      }) withShutdown: (self args at: #shutdown)))
